# Project context

Before implementing features, read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) (status, phases, phone handoff) and [ARCHITECTURE.md](../../ARCHITECTURE.md) (stack, data flow, folder layout).

## Non-negotiables

- **Stack:** Next.js (`apps/web`), Hono Node API (`services/api`), worker ingest for PRT GTFS/GTFS-RT, Postgres+PostGIS, Redis, Expo later (`apps/mobile`). TypeScript monorepo with pnpm.
- **PRT data** is fetched only in worker/api ingest — never from browser or mobile clients.
- **End of session:** Update AGENTS.md — Implementation status, Current focus, Session log.

## Layout

`apps/web`, `apps/mobile`, `services/api`, `services/worker`, `packages/transit-core`, `packages/api-client`, `packages/shared`.

Follow the next unchecked phase in AGENTS.md unless the user specifies otherwise.
